---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { BAND, MEMBERS } from "../data/band";
---

<Layout
  title={`About | ${BAND.name}`}
  description={`Who we are: the story and line-up of ${BAND.name}.`}
  active="about"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-6 pt-16 pb-12">
    <h1 class="m-0 mb-4 font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-5xl">About us</h1>
    <p class="m-0 max-w-[640px] text-lg leading-relaxed text-body">{BAND.shortBio}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-12 px-6 pb-20 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr]">
    <div class="scroll-reveal space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
      <h2 class="m-0 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Our story</h2>
      <p>
        Would you believe the bands first incarnation started up in the early 1990's. We were
        playing gigs in an around Exeter and the South West, the set being a mixture of covers and
        our own music.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our last gig in this period of our lives was at The Cavern in Exeter 1994, a really fitting
        way to bow out on this period of our musical lives.
      </p>
      <p>
        After going our separate ways for close on 30 years, a few fortunate connections via Social
        Media brought us back together for a bit of a nostalgia trip. It was then that we suggested
        it might be a bit of a laugh to actually strap on a guitar and see if we still had what it
        takes to make a decent racket.
      </p>
      <p>
        After a couple of non-drummer practice sessions, we decided to advertise for a drummer,
        which brought Kat into the Ecru Stretch family. Since then we have been practicing hard,
        getting better and gradually introducing new songs into our ever expanding repertoire.
      </p>
      <p>
        The first gig with our current line up was at the Cramptonbury 2026 festival in
        Carhampton, near Minehead.
      </p>
      <p>
        We wear our musical influences very firmly on our sleeves, and as you will see from our
        social media output, these influences range from REM, The Smiths, The Cure and Talking
        Heads amongst many others
      </p>
      <p>
        We are currently working on new material and looking to get the next set of gigs arranged
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-reveal">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-5 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">The band</h2>
      <ul class="m-0 list-none divide-y divide-line border-y border-line p-0">
        {MEMBERS.map((member) => (
          <li class="py-4">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <span class="font-medium text-ink">{member.name}</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted">{member.role}</span>
            </div>
            {member.bio && <p class="m-0 mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">{member.bio}</p>}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
